  "title": "Kourovka problem 17.54 (main)",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Does there exist a non-hereditary local formation F of finite groups such\nthat in every finite group the set of all F-subnormal subgroups is a sublattice of the\nsubgroup lattice?\n   A negative answer would solve 9.75, since all the hereditary local formations with\nthe same property are already known.                                S. F. Kamornikov",
